{"root":"longgar","ipa":"/loŋɡar/","core":"形容词。指物体松动、不紧；也指时间、规则或经济状况宽松、宽裕。","pos":["形容词"],"scenes":["高频","生活","工作"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/loŋɡar/","zh":"松的，宽松的","phrases":[{"t":"baut yang longgar","zh":"松动的螺丝"},{"t":"aturan yang longgar","zh":"宽松的规定"},{"t":"keuangan yang longgar","zh":"宽裕的经济状况"}],"examples":[{"t":"Baju ini terasa longgar di badan saya.","zh":"这件衣服穿在我身上感觉很宽松。"},{"t":"Jangan biarkan baut itu tetap longgar.","zh":"别让那个螺丝一直松着。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"longgar","ipa":"/loŋɡar/","zh":"松的","phrase":{"t":"ikatan longgar","zh":"松散的束缚"},"example":{"t":"Tanah itu sangat longgar.","zh":"那片土地非常松软。"}},{"w":"melonggarkan","ipa":"/məloŋɡarkan/","zh":"使松动，放宽","phrase":{"t":"melonggarkan aturan","zh":"放宽规定"},"example":{"t":"Pemerintah melonggarkan kebijakan karantina.","zh":"政府放宽了隔离政策。"}},{"w":"kelonggaran","ipa":"/kəloŋɡaran/","zh":"松动，宽限，余地","phrase":{"t":"memberi kelonggaran","zh":"给予宽限"},"example":{"t":"Dia meminta kelonggaran waktu untuk menyelesaikan tugas.","zh":"他请求给予完成任务的时间宽限。"}}],"derSlugs":["longgar","melonggarkan","kelonggaran"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-28T08:37:24.733Z","src":"base"}